{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>現年45歲的李施嬅（Selena），2003年參選香港小姐入行，近年憑劇集《金宵大廈》系列及《新聞女王》系列人氣急升。李施嬅出生富裕家庭，在7歲的時候已隨家人移民加拿大生活，在當地頂尖學府多倫多大學主修會計，曾是學校商科學生會副主席，絕對是高材生一名，她更曾被媽媽勸退圈創業，但李施嬅因太熱愛演藝行業拒絕。李施嬅近年憑演技再次紅遍中港兩地，吸金力驚人。日前李施嬅現身直播，期間大騷流利法語，相當迷人！</p><figure><img alt=\"李施嬅44歲生日。(ig圖片)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250223/970306873477566464873610.jpeg/4BekBnI4ie60AqCAiClxGWypUObhVbI3MAkEFTAJBBU\"/><figcaption>李施嬅44歲生日。(ig圖片)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"李施嬅變裝後。(李施嬅抖音)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260429/1126163035162284032352698.jpeg/SkcDOC9Xc2Ds0Hjn4ui7RvO6CVxQVNfoZNt66WTbeuk\"/><figcaption>李施嬅變裝後。(李施嬅抖音)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"李施嬅好靚女。(李施嬅抖音)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260429/1126163028547473408784301.jpeg/p1F8faeyZuNtna5WBOZgOF9jCa7UYS27Lyd59y8nefc\"/><figcaption>李施嬅好靚女。(李施嬅抖音)</figcaption></figure><p>李施嬅直播騷流利法文</p><p>李施嬅早前現身直播，她穿上露肩藍色上衣，一頭披肩長髮，又靚又有女人味！直播期間，旁邊的人突然爆料李施嬅識講法文，李施嬅亦大方承認：「我會一點點！」她又怕醜道：「我害羞了！」但李施嬅隨即以法語自信說出「我不懂說法語」、「你好嗎」、「我很開心」、「今天我很開心」。在加拿大長大的李施嬅自然識講幾句法文，相當犀利！網民亦盛讚李施嬅可愛：「她一開口說法語就把我萌到了」。</p><figure><img alt=\"李施嬅在直播中大騷流利法文。（小紅書）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260615/1143226646661435392973185.png/ZRpUAcCY5Cvj0m4S83pCkYeyhJKqoxUMQGlZ_0BpWf8\"/><figcaption>李施嬅在直播中大騷流利法文。（小紅書）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"李施嬅講法文好迷人！（小紅書）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260615/1143226644434128896613205.png/ysqa8nLSvd1AtAb2T92F35v-MZPnIdb-VSFt61Uhbes\"/><figcaption>李施嬅講法文好迷人！（小紅書）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"靚女！（小紅書）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260615/1143226642122936320378214.png/GE8Otcepw_uy7uiUDbTgIav7Eab-E2Pn2X9Iutl_SLo\"/><figcaption>靚女！（小紅書）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"李施嬅（IG@selenaleelalee）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20231205/808732659734810624583172.jpeg/mYfYuepnlwPbbIVdLSyjNqn9pHaYFdKZQIHKYUCBymE\"/><figcaption>李施嬅（IG@selenaleelalee）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"李施嬅（IG@selenaleelalee）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20231205/808732668941438976962754.jpeg/zQxlCgopKk5WTM0s2Ul-EU1CCm4EtX0d017WHNNe1hw\"/><figcaption>李施嬅（IG@selenaleelalee）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"李施嬅（IG@selenaleelalee）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20231205/808732671768530944823056.jpeg/dMbD0eMjzRHTbyjsVLuPwFu9UC02I_TNLX7eLy1-3i8\"/><figcaption>李施嬅（IG@selenaleelalee）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"李施嬅（IG@selenaleelalee）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20231205/808732679801016320389156.jpeg/ACsjRq8qNU8RKX1aihZgMEGnH8TS9E5wtSvD6rUrw-o\"/><figcaption>李施嬅（IG@selenaleelalee）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"李施嬅（IG@selenaleelalee）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20231205/808732687615397888457163.jpeg/Au2v_eQHHCCsPoNrD_M54xfg3oJmVA24QagfKkGoHyo\"/><figcaption>李施嬅（IG@selenaleelalee）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"李施嬅（IG@selenaleelalee）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20231205/808732690144694272714850.jpeg/RN9xa_ooP0vptmwNNSAOwlu0slio6MVAH0fwSB9H8Eg\"/><figcaption>李施嬅（IG@selenaleelalee）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"李施嬅獲閨密慶祝44歲生日。(ig圖片)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250223/970306873846665216724058.jpeg/b4T2GN5blJLlLb9zlbTCL353fuJeJ0zWqJF2D6iRdg8\"/><figcaption>李施嬅獲閨密慶祝44歲生日。(ig圖片)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"李施嬅獲閨密慶祝44歲生日。(ig圖片)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250223/970306882864943104691307.jpeg/wactNjf5MHYxSB-6CKPr6W2GUv3eYtru2MVfaNjFX2g\"/><figcaption>李施嬅獲閨密慶祝44歲生日。(ig圖片)</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-06-15T22:18:25.365696+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":664,"images":14,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none"}}